-          "Entering the job market as a fresher in 2026 presents unique challenges. With Applicant Tracking Systems (ATS) filtering out over 70% of resumes before they ever reach a human recruiter, having a standard, text-heavy CV is no longer enough. Recruiters are looking for impact, specific skill mappings, and clean formatting. Resume banana ke baad aapko apni productivity aur skills bhi AI se boost karni chahiye — iske liye hamara <a href='/post/how-students-job-seekers-use-ai-grow-faster' class='text-cyan-500 font-bold hover:underline'>Students aur Job Seekers ke liye AI Guide</a> bahut helpful rahega. Aur AI tools ke aur bhi free options ke liye <a href='/post/best-free-ai-tools-for-students-2026' class='text-cyan-500 font-bold hover:underline'>Best Free AI Tools for Students</a> padhein.",
